{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your own quest to never lose again in\u00a0<i>Shoresy: Legends of the North</i>. This pick-up-and-play sports game offers two distinct modes of play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinny Mode - Go head-to-head with friends in the local multiplayer Shinny Mode\u00a0by drafting your team of fan-favourite characters to run \u2018em up and fill \u2018em in. Charge your fight metre to knock out your rivals or\u00a0grab\u00a0a power-up to gain an edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode - Put on the\u00a0Sudbury Blueberry Bulldogs\u00a0sweater in the original narrative-driven Story Mode and play alongside Shoresy on an epic hockey adventure to defeat the legendary Hockey Godz. Create your own character, level up your stats, and unlock new gear in this hockey RPG campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You ready? Good, \u2018cause you\u2019re going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1763832424\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras_big/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1763832424 width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SHORESY</i>,</strong> created by and starring Jared Keeso and produced by New Metric Media in association with Play Fun Games and Crave, sees the titular character Shoresy (Keeso) and the Sudbury Bulldogs of the Northern Ontario Senior Hockey Organization (The NOSHO) on a quest to never lose again. SHORESY returned for season four on Crave in Canada in January, and Hulu in the US in February, with seasons one through three streaming on the platforms, as well. The fifth season of the series completed production in April, with a premiere date to be announced.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1538010?t=1763832424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/88c4d908093042493a04a5551eb8ebf3f30822e7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763832424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/26ff21e3a997b9fa8e7865c64f2119242a0dd50e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763832424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/26ff21e3a997b9fa8e7865c64f2119242a0dd50e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763832424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your own quest to never lose again in\u00a0<i>Shoresy: Legends of the North</i>. This pick-up-and-play sports game offers two distinct modes of play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinny Mode - Go head-to-head with friends in the local multiplayer Shinny Mode\u00a0by drafting your team of fan-favourite characters to run \u2018em up and fill \u2018em in. Charge your fight metre to knock out your rivals or\u00a0grab\u00a0a power-up to gain an edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode - Put on the\u00a0Sudbury Blueberry Bulldogs\u00a0sweater in the original narrative-driven Story Mode and play alongside Shoresy on an epic hockey adventure to defeat the legendary Hockey Godz. Create your own character, level up your stats, and unlock new gear in this hockey RPG campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You ready? Good, \u2018cause you\u2019re going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1763832424\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/extras_big/b5372eba67b0b6bb3c9bbf149760ce08.avif?t=1763832424 width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SHORESY</i>,</strong> created by and starring Jared Keeso and produced by New Metric Media in association with Play Fun Games and Crave, sees the titular character Shoresy (Keeso) and the Sudbury Bulldogs of the Northern Ontario Senior Hockey Organization (The NOSHO) on a quest to never lose again. SHORESY returned for season four on Crave in Canada in January, and Hulu in the US in February, with seasons one through three streaming on the platforms, as well. The fifth season of the series completed production in April, with a premiere date to be announced.</p>","developers":["Treewood Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538010/35907fc5baf90ab12c2ce5bb75c34ece261e3d17/header.jpg?t=1763832424","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Shoresy Gameco Inc.<br />\r\n\u00a9 2024 Treewood Studios Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 64 + Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1538010/219555012/44ef4b72e9a99efc7d0a7e606ef905ef0d2745e7/175330